      "writtenOn": "2020-08-31T20:58:37Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "A USB-HID device may be connected before suspend. USB-HID is a wake source from suspend. And we don\u0027t know if a USB-HID device is connected, better not turn it off.",
      "parentUuid": "12e98c30_b505b7b0",
